    {
      "id": "blk_c336343f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "狩王鹫原为七丘地区的原生生物，早年曾与流亡至黎那汐塔的七丘先祖共居高地。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9870baf0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "黎那汐塔第一次黑潮爆发时，灾厄曾波及狩王鹫栖息的分界山，原始种群几近灭绝。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_104b36ee",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "此后，狩王鹫多以由中枢信标固定频率的公共声骸形态存在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_75ad90fe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "后世的七丘人注意到这类声骸型狩王鹫依旧保有追逐猎物、感应外部频率的本能，遂将其训练为可追踪黑潮造物并协同作战的公共狩猎声骸。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
